From: ButterflyOS development <noreply@butterflyos.local>
Subject: [PATCH] check battery status every two seconds

Improve plug and unplug feedback while retaining change-only redraws.
Live testing on the development Flip showed roughly four seconds from
plugging in to the icon update; the user accepted this response time.
The polling interval does not guarantee end-to-end notification latency.

--- a/es-core/src/watchers/BatteryLevelWatcher.h
+++ b/es-core/src/watchers/BatteryLevelWatcher.h
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@
 	bool enabled() override { return true; };
 
 	int  initialUpdateTime() override { return 0; }		// Immediate
-	int  updateTime() override { return 5 * 1000; }		// 5 seconds
+	int  updateTime() override { return 2 * 1000; }		// 2 seconds
 
 	bool check() override;
 
